                                                        A Midsummer Night’s Dream
                                                    </div>
                                                    <p class="m-0">
                                                        The first production under the banner of SSLA Presents, A Midsummer Night’s Dream, revolved around the marriage of Theseus and Hippolyta and the greater idea of love. The SSLA production delved into the dreamy spectacle of the Shakespearean comedy, with Professor Ananya Parikh noting that it was a conscious aesthetic choice to make the production spectacular “right from the start”. The community effort poured into the very first production of SSLA set the unmistakable tone for the years to follow. 
